{"root":"pesona","ipa":"/pəˈsɔna/","core":"魅力、魔力、迷人之处，指一个人或事物所具有的吸引力或感染力。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/pəˈsɔna/","zh":"魅力、迷人之处","phrases":[{"t":"pesona diri","zh":"个人魅力"},{"t":"daya pesona","zh":"吸引力、魅力"},{"t":"memiliki pesona","zh":"具有魅力"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia memiliki pesona yang luar biasa.","zh":"他拥有非凡的魅力。"},{"t":"Pemandangan alam ini memiliki pesona tersendiri.","zh":"这片自然风光有着独特的魅力。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"pesona","ipa":"/pəˈsɔna/","zh":"魅力","phrase":{"t":"pesona wajah","zh":"容貌魅力"},"example":{"t":"Senyumnya menambah pesona wajahnya.","zh":"她的微笑增添了她脸上的魅力。"}},{"w":"memesona","ipa":"/məˈməsɔna/","zh":"迷人的、令人着迷的","phrase":{"t":"pemandangan memesona","zh":"迷人的景色"},"example":{"t":"Suaranya sangat memesona para penonton.","zh":"她的声音非常令观众着迷。"}},{"w":"memesonakan","ipa":"/məˈməsɔnakan/","zh":"使……着迷、使……倾倒","phrase":{"t":"memesonakan hati","zh":"令人心醉"},"example":{"t":"Pertunjukan itu memesonakan seluruh penonton.","zh":"那场演出让全场观众为之倾倒。"}},{"w":"terpesona","ipa":"/tərpəˈsɔna/","zh":"被迷住的、着迷的","phrase":{"t":"terpesona melihat","zh":"看得入迷"},"example":{"t":"Saya terpesona oleh keindahan kota ini.","zh":"我被这座城市的美丽所迷住。"}}],"derSlugs":["pesona","memesona","memesonakan","terpesona"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-27T16:42:02.470Z","src":"base"}